---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy | CoverData" lang="en">
  <main class="container legal">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>

    <p>
      In accordance with Regulation (EU) 2016/679 (GDPR) and Spanish Organic Law 3/2018
      on Personal Data Protection and digital rights, users are informed about the
      processing of their personal data.
    </p>

    <h2>1. Data controller</h2>
    <p>
      Controller: Cover Data S.L.<br />
      Email: <a href="mailto:info@cover-data.com">info@cover-data.com</a><br />
      Country: Spain
    </p>

    <h2>2. Purpose of processing</h2>
    <p>Personal data collected through this website will be used to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Respond to enquiries and requests for information.</li>
      <li>Manage commercial and professional communications.</li>
      <li>Provide contracted services.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. Legal basis</h2>
    <p>
      Processing is based on the user’s consent and, where applicable, on the
      performance of a contract or compliance with legal obligations.
    </p>

    <h2>4. Data retention</h2>
    <p>
      Personal data will be kept for as long as a relationship with the user exists
      or for the periods required by law.
    </p>

    <h2>5. User rights</h2>
    <p>
      Users may exercise their rights of access, rectification, erasure, objection,
      restriction and data portability by writing to
      <a href="mailto:info@cover-data.com">info@cover-data.com</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>6. Security</h2>
    <p>
      CoverData applies the necessary technical and organisational measures to
      ensure the security and confidentiality of personal data.
    </p>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal h1 { font-size: 34px; margin-bottom: 18px; }
  .legal h2 { margin-top: 22px; font-size: 20px; }
  .legal p, .legal li { line-height: 1.7; font-size: 15px; color: #334155; }
  .legal ul { margin-left: 18px; }
</style>
